{"title": "Gates of Kryta (Zaishen quest)", "pageid": 202358, "revid": 2250658, "text": {"*": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><table style=\"margin: 0 0 0.5em 1em; border:1px solid silver; float:right; font-size:90%; text-align:left;\" cellpadding=\"5\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"font-size:110%; text-align:center; background-color:#ACD\">Gates of Kryta\n</th></tr>\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Quest#Section\" title=\"Quest\">Section</a>\n</th>\n<td>Zaishen Mission Quests\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD\"><a href=\"/wiki/Campaign\" title=\"Campaign\">Campaign</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Core\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Core\">Core</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\">Given by\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Zaishen_Mission\" title=\"Zaishen Mission\">Zaishen Mission</a> <br />in <a href=\"/wiki/Great_Temple_of_Balthazar\" title=\"Great Temple of Balthazar\">Great Temple of Balthazar</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\">Type\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Secondary_quest\" title=\"Secondary quest\">Secondary quest</a>&#160;<img alt=\"Rotating quest\" src=\"/images/7/77/Tango-recharge-blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"Rotating quest\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" />\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background-color:#ACD;\">Map(s)\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Gates_of_Kryta_map.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Gates of Kryta map.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/b/bb/Gates_of_Kryta_map.jpg/200px-Gates_of_Kryta_map.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"288\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/b/bb/Gates_of_Kryta_map.jpg/300px-Gates_of_Kryta_map.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/b/bb/Gates_of_Kryta_map.jpg/400px-Gates_of_Kryta_map.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"436\" data-file-height=\"627\" /></a><br /><small>(Click to enlarge)</small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Complete <a href=\"/wiki/Gates_of_Kryta\" title=\"Gates of Kryta\">Gates of Kryta</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quest_information\">Quest information</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gates_of_Kryta_(Zaishen_quest)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Quest information\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Objectives\">Objectives</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gates_of_Kryta_(Zaishen_quest)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Objectives\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Destroy the <a href=\"/wiki/Undead\" title=\"Undead\">undead</a> in the swamp south of <a href=\"/wiki/Lion%27s_Arch\" title=\"Lion&#39;s Arch\">Lion's Arch</a>.</li>\n<li>*BONUS* Retrieve the <a href=\"/wiki/Orrian_Text\" title=\"Orrian Text\">Orrian Text</a> for the <a href=\"/wiki/Orrian_Historian_McClain\" title=\"Orrian Historian McClain\">Historian</a>.</li>\n<li>*BONUS* Complete the mission in <a href=\"/wiki/Hard_Mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hard Mode\">Hard Mode</a>.</li>\n<li>See <a href=\"/wiki/Zehnchu\" title=\"Zehnchu\">Zehnchu</a> [<a href=\"/wiki/Zaishen\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Zaishen\">Zaishen</a> Challenge] for your reward.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Reward\">Reward</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gates_of_Kryta_(Zaishen_quest)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Reward\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>1,000 <a href=\"/wiki/Experience\" title=\"Experience\">Experience</a></li>\n<li>250 <a href=\"/wiki/Gold\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gold\">Gold</a></li>\n<li>Complete the Base Objective for 15 <a href=\"/wiki/Copper_Zaishen_Coin\" title=\"Copper Zaishen Coin\">Zaishen Copper Coins</a>.</li>\n<li>Complete the first *BONUS* Objective for an additional 22 Zaishen Copper Coins.</li>\n<li>Complete the second *BONUS* Objective for an additional 37 Zaishen Copper Coins.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Walkthrough\">Walkthrough</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gates_of_Kryta_(Zaishen_quest)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Walkthrough\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>As per the <a href=\"/wiki/Gates_of_Kryta#Walkthrough\" title=\"Gates of Kryta\"> Gates of Kryta</a> mission.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gates_of_Kryta_(Zaishen_quest)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Initial_dialogue\">Initial dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gates_of_Kryta_(Zaishen_quest)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Initial dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dt>Zaishen Mission</dt>\n<dd><i>\"Undead have risen from the swamps, forcing Lion's Arch to close its gates. Cleanse the swamp of the undead infestation.\"</i></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tick_green.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Yes\"><img alt=\"Yes\" src=\"/images/5/52/Tick_green.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>&#160;<b>Accept:</b> <i>\"I can do that!\"</i></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Icon_No_ingame.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"No\"><img alt=\"No\" src=\"/images/0/09/Icon_No_ingame.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>&#160;<b>Decline:</b> <i>\"No, I'm way too busy today.\"</i></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tango-question-mark.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ask\"><img alt=\"Ask\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Tango-question-mark.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>&#160;<b>Ask:</b> <i>\"The battle rages on! All able-bodied heroes should hasten to defend those bravely protecting <a href=\"/wiki/Tyria_(world)\" title=\"Tyria (world)\">Tyria</a>.\"</i></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Reward_dialogue\">Reward dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gates_of_Kryta_(Zaishen_quest)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Reward dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dt>Zehnchu</dt>\n<dd><i>\"Excellent work! The Zaishen admire your dedication.\"</i></dd></dl>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261009043614\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.046 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 331/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3455/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 968/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 9/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   29.456      1 -total\n 54.02%   15.913      1 Template:Quest_infobox\n 45.34%   13.356      1 Template:Offer_dialogue\n 11.48%    3.382      1 Template:Infobox_campaign_row\n  9.91%    2.918      1 Template:Infobox_requirements_row\n  9.18%    2.704      1 Template:Yes\n  9.18%    2.703      1 Template:Ask\n  8.93%    2.630      1 Template:No\n  7.97%    2.347      1 Template:Quest_icon\n  7.36%    2.167      1 Template:Infobox_images_first_row\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key en_wiki:pcache:idhash:202358-0!canonical and timestamp 20261009043614 and revision id 2250658.\n -->\n</div>"}}